/v1/","context":{"app_id":4636410,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4636410-1846651706695636","game_id":"steam-4636410","kind":"announcement","title":"Flight Date | Steam Next Fest Demo Gameplay","summary":"How hard can it be to bring people together? ✈️Flight Date is a cozy logic puzzle that turns seemingly simple meetups into absurdly complicated travel plans!Join us during Steam Next Fest for a look at the gameplay. 💜 The free demo is available now! Give it a try and let us know what you think!About this broadcast: This is pre-recorded demo gameplay playing on a loop, not a live gameplay session.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T15:03:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706695636","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:34:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4636410-1841579228672479","game_id":"steam-4636410","kind":"announcement","title":"Meet Chirp Chirp Games 🐥 The Story of the Flight Date","summary":"Hi! After the demo launch, we received more support than we could have imagined. We gathered lots of feedback on the demo and got to know so many lovely people. So far, we’ve mostly been talking about Flight Date, and we thought it was finally time to introduce ourselves too.So… hi. We’re Chirp Chirp Games!Flight Date actually started as a game jam project earlier this year. On March 8, we made the first version for Hack the Loop: Women’s Day Game Jam, where it won Best Game Design. We were prou","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-23T00:23:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228672479","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:34:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4636410-1840310314344839","game_id":"steam-4636410","kind":"announcement","title":"The Flight Date Demo Is Live! ✈️💗","summary":"Hi everyone!First of all, we want to say a huge welcome to everyone who has just discovered Flight Date, followed the game, or added it to their wishlist! 💗This is the first time we’ve reached this many people. We actually REALLY released the demo, and you’re actually REALLY playing it??? We’re still having a hard time believing it, hehe.There are still a few bugs you may run into. We’re constantly checking the game and fixing issues as we find them. If you encounter anything, letting us know th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-07T12:18:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314344839","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:34:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4636410-1839041357030804","game_id":"steam-4636410","kind":"announcement","title":"Mac Support Is Here — Playtest Ends on Sunday! 🍎","summary":"Great news, we’ve added Mac support to the Flight Date Playtest!Mac players can now download the playtest directly from their Steam Library and join in.We’ve also extended the playtest, and it will remain open until Sunday, July 26.Your feedback is valuable for us because we're so close to releasing the demo! Thank you to everyone who has played and shared feedback so far.— Chirp Chirp Games ✈️","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-24T21:50:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357030804","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:34:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4636410-1837955055359822","game_id":"steam-4636410","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest #2 Starts July 18! ✈️","summary":"The Flight Date Playtest Begins July 18! (with a delay)edited: Sorry everyone, we have one day delay with the release. The version is not stable yet, we have some bugs that we know of, we don't wat to bother you with those. Therefore, we decided to release it on Saturday. Thank you for your patience with us.We’ve been working on a new version of Flight Date based on the feedback from our first playtest, and we’re finally ready to share it with you!The next playtest session will begin on:Saturday","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-11T18:13:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055359822","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:34:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4636410-1835236783575642","game_id":"steam-4636410","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest V1 Notes: What We Learned ✈️","summary":"Hello everyone!Our first Flight Date playtest is now behind us, and we wanted to share a small update about what we learned from it.First of all, thank you so much to everyone who played, shared feedback, reported bugs, or just took the time to write down their thoughts. This was our first public playtest, so seeing people actually solve levels, get confused, enjoy the planning, and suggest new ideas was incredibly helpful for us.What players likedOne of the biggest things we were happy to see w","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-16T21:36:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783575642","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:34:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4636410-1835236783566388","game_id":"steam-4636410","kind":"announcement","title":"Flight Date Playtest is Live — Play Now! ✈️💙","summary":"The first Flight Date playtest is officially live!You can now jump into an early version of the game. During this playtest, we’d love to hear your thoughts on the puzzles, difficulty, tutorial, UI, pacing, and anything else that stands out to you.If you already requested access, check your Steam notifications or your Library. Flight Date should be ready to play.We’ll also be around on Discord during the playtest to collect feedback, answer questions, and fix issues as quickly as we can:https://d","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-13T18:13:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783566388","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:34:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4636410-1834602721187176","game_id":"steam-4636410","kind":"announcement","title":"✈️ Playtest Session #1 Starts June 12","summary":"Hello everyone! 💙We’re excited to announce that the first Flight Date playtest session has officially been scheduled.📅 Starts: Friday, June 12 — 20:00 CEST 📅 Ends: Monday, June 15 — 23:00 CESTIf you’ve already requested access, keep an eye on your Steam notifications. We’ll be inviting players before the playtest begins.During this playtest, you’ll be able to experience an early version of Flight Date, help us identify issues, and share feedback that will directly shape the game’s development.We","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-04T11:00:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721187176","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:34:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4636410-1833968530899185","game_id":"steam-4636410","kind":"announcement","title":"💜 250+ Wishlist!","summary":"Hey everyone!Flight Date has officially passed 250+ wishlists ✈️ (as we post this it's 264)It may seem like a small number in the big world of Steam, but for small indie team, it means a lot.Every wishlist, follow, comment, repost, and kind message genuinely helps us keep going while we work toward the playtest and demo.We’ve also been seeing people join the playtest from different countries around the world lately, and honestly… that feeling is surreal.Thank you for supporting Flight Date 💙If y","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-02T01:37:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530899185","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:34:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4636410-1833968530894438","game_id":"steam-4636410","kind":"announcement","title":"Flight Date Playtest Signups Are Open 💌","summary":"Hello everyone from our first community update!We're excited to announce that you can now request access to our upcoming playtest!We’ll soon announce when the playtest goes live, and you will be able to try Flight Date early, share feedback, and help shape the game during development.If you'd like to help us test the game, click the “Request Access” button on our Steam page 💙Thank you for supporting us. We genuinely can’t wait to hear what you think!Wishlist & Playtest:","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-30T23:50:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530894438","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:34:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4636410":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:17:06Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T03:17:06Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4636410":"2026-10-26T03:17:06Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4636410":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:17:06Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T